1954,58,90,17]],"links":[["Colleton County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-carolina/colleton-county"],["ARC or PLC in Colleton County","/arc-plc/south-carolina/colleton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, November to December came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids, and January to February at 49%. So far in 2026, March to April was published at 14% of normal on the middle of the grids. On grid 15199, the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 71.6.</p>"}
